===================================================================================================
[Load|Store] Multiple [Increment|Decrement] [After|Before]
===================================================================================================
LDMIA r1, {r2, r3, r4}
  r2 = r1[0]
  r3 = r1[4]
  r4 = r1[8]

   after instruction r1 = r1 + 4 * 3

STMIA  r1, {r2, r3}
   r1[0]  = r2
   r1[4]  = r3



===================================================================================================
[MCR|MRC] CoProcessor Registers
http://www.heyrick.co.uk/assembler/coprocmnd.html#mrc
===================================================================================================
* These transfer control from ARM register to CoProcessor registers
* MRC transfers from C - > R 
* MCR transfers from R - > C 
** i.e., the last alphabet is *FROM* where R = ARM Register and C = Coprocessor
* MRC  co-pro  op  ARM-reg   copro-reg  copro-reg2  op2 
* e.g., mcr p15, 0, r0, c8, c3, 1  // flush TLB by MVA 

    
